<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>
      Your verification code for registering an organization on
      <strong>{{appName}}</strong> is:
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em">
      {{otp}}
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">
      The code expires in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes and can only be used once.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666">
      If you did not start an organization registration, you can ignore this message.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
